  `:raw` is `nil`. Raises `ArgumentError` for a code outside the closed table.

      iex> refusal = AshGraphLaw.Refusal.build(:not_admitted, "custom", %{"k" => 1})
      iex> {refusal.code, refusal.message, refusal.details, refusal.raw}
      {:not_admitted, "custom", %{"k" => 1}, nil}

      iex> AshGraphLaw.Refusal.build(:not_a_code, "x")
      ** (ArgumentError) unknown refusal code: :not_a_code
  """
